  "description": "Group 2 discriminator (Jet 4 MDB DAO): resolves exact row padding boundary on 1-byte and 3-byte fixed tables (F1V: fixedSize=1 v=1; F1B9: fixedSize=1 v=0 mask=2B; F3: fixedSize=3 v=0; F1U: 1-byte fixed updated to NULL; B1U: zero-fixed Bool updated True->False). Keeps whole file before and after update.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
    "clearErrorInfoBefore",
    "excepinfo",
    "deferredFill",
    "errorInfo"
  ],
  "pathBinding": "attempt-local-copy",
  "inputs": [],
  "program": [
